## 📌 Project Overview
**GBGHMVNNEXSONJEN** stands for:
- **G**itHub - Source Code Management
- **B**uild - Maven Build Tool
- **G** - (Bridge)
- **H** - (Hub)
- **M**aven - Build Automation
- **V**ersioning - Nexus Artifact Management
- **N**exus - Repository Manager
- **EX** - Execution
- **SON** - SonarQube Code Analysis
- **JEN** - Jenkins CI/CD Orchestration

End-to-end CI/CD pipeline implementing DevOps best practices from scratch.

